<title>ECUADOR: TENNIS-ECUADOR AND URUGUAY 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ECUADOR AND URUGUAY 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador and Uruguay were level 1-1</p>
<p>after Friday's opening singles matches in their Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>American Zone group two final tie.</p>
<p>Results (Ecuador names first):</p>
<p>Nicolas Lapenti beat Federico Dondo 6-4 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Pablo Campana lost to Marcelo Filippini 2-6 1-6 1-6</p>
</text>
